# Keep Out, second mode: "Destroy target enchantment." Bot2 has Clachan Festival (a Kindred Enchantment) and a Mox Jet (an
# artifact). Bot1 cannot aim the mode at the Mox, and destroys the Festival (the Kithkin tokens it made stay).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Keep Out
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Clachan Festival
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Clachan Festival.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Keep Out.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Destroy target enchantment)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Clachan Festival)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Clachan Festival
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Keep Out
